{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"命题 (同伦类型论)"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"命题(同伦类型论)"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦类型论","text":"同伦类型论"}},{"Plain":"中, 称类型 $A$ 是命题, 是指 $A$ 的任意两个元素都相等, 即\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{isProp}(A) := \\prod_{x,y : A} x =_A y.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>对于命题 $A$, 若 $A$ 有一个元素, 那么 $A$ "},{"Local":{"url":"可缩(同伦类型论)","text":"可缩"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"真值","text":"真值"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}